Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.79,0:00:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That piercing noise...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.33,0:00:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An amusement park?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.09,0:00:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why in the world am I riding on\Na Ferris wheel in my pajamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.75,0:00:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.87,0:00:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.19,0:00:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember being in the desert, riding\Nthrough Saudi Arabia on camelback.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.73,0:00:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.99,0:01:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they abandon me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.49,0:01:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a soul anywhere\Nin the amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.03,0:01:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why do I hear the cries of a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.57,0:01:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for that matter, where is it?
