Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:01:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.53,0:02:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin! Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.51,0:02:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop screaming and shaking the bed like\Nthat creepy girl from The Exorcist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.33,0:02:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're weirding me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.69,0:02:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ask stupid questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.19,0:02:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now come on and get up already, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.23,0:02:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After breakfast, we're\Ngonna take to the skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like another scorcher today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.11,0:02:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a terrible nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.11,0:02:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was truly horrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.43,0:02:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lay on the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.09,0:02:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to hear all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.27,0:02:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the thing is, I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.19,0:02:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've forgotten it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.29,0:02:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, it was petrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when you woke me up,\Nyou pulled me out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.31,0:02:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wish we could talk more about it,\Nbut we've got to get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.23,0:02:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a cut on my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how'd it get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I'm going to be a star dust?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.23,0:03:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hundred years ago, I'm\Ncalled to be a star dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The men are going towards the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the tunnel of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.05,0:03:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a destiny.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:36.63,0:04:41.42,Title 3,ep,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,630)\pos(197,815)\fscx86}Episode 19: Death 13, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.23,0:04:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar are already headed to the\Nplane, so we'll meet them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.31,0:04:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the way I hear it, we're\Ntraveling 500 kilometers today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.87,0:04:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop, my poor dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dog is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.51,0:04:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would do such a thing? A dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.89,0:05:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn that I saw\Na dead dog not too long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever did this is sick, but\Nthere's nothing we can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.09,0:05:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.93,0:05:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.89,0:05:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.47,0:05:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a dang second there, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you mean you\Ncan't sell us the plane now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seem to recall you taking my money\Nlast night and saying it was a done deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get a full refund, but first\Nwe need to see a baby with a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.15,0:05:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 39 degrees Celsius. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doctor in this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we have no choice but to take\Nthe baby somewhere else to get help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, what do you say to\Nus taking that plane over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say that one's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.77,0:05:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of argument?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.07,0:05:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.57,0:05:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:05:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember hearing a baby's cries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.77,0:06:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to use the plane\Nafter it gets back tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can renegotiate and talk prices then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say tomorrow night?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.19,0:06:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our group has someone's life on\Nthe line just like you guys do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.57,0:06:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to spend two\Ndays pissing around this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what you're telling me is\Nyou'd rather let that baby die?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.25,0:06:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I have a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.93,0:06:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can kill two birds\Nwith one stone by having
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these gentlemen taken to\Nthe doctor on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.29,0:06:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice idea, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Cessna is built to carry four, but\Nsurely there's enough room for a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I just saw it smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.11,0:06:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that the child already has teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.97,0:06:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about this, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to leave\Nyour baby with these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.29,0:06:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.59,0:06:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous for\Na baby to come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.75,0:07:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told him this would be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, just try and take it easy, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.07,0:07:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way a stand could catch a plane\Nflying hundreds of kilometers an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.07,0:07:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we even made sure the\Nplane itself wasn't a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say we're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.65,0:07:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm far more worried about the old man's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flying than I am in\Nattack from enemy stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.09,0:07:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I wonder who\Nthat baby belonged to. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.37,0:07:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you're not the\Nmother of that child, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it by the well this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, from the moment I heard the babies\Ncrying, I wasn't able to help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.69,0:07:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt I had to put him on that plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:07:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.77,0:08:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's just me, but I always\Nget so tired when I get on a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's all right with you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.59,0:08:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, I think I'm going\Nto take a Monday catnap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.19,0:08:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kakyoin, where the hell\Nare we? Where'd Mr. Joestar go?
