Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the same dream I had this morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.49,0:08:38.53,SFX3,3,0,0,0,,{=13}{\blur0.7\bord18.34\fscx198.7\fscy152.85\frz2.066\pos(984.52,-66.32)\c&H000000&}Doom
Dialogue: 2,0:08:38.49,0:08:38.53,SFX3,3,0,0,0,,{=13}{\blur0.7\bord0\fscx198.7\fscy152.85\frz2.066\pos(984.52,-66.32)\4a&HFF&}Doom
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.07,0:08:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now it seems we're\Nboth inside the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? A dream? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a stupid dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.39,0:08:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it's only a dream,\Nwho cares if the dog is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, you can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:09:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dreams are only as scary as you make them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's kind of the way it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, just try and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.57,0:09:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I relax when we're\Nhaving the same dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose you have a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.49,0:09:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in a dream, isn't anything possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, would you look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.97,0:09:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dreaming thing is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.27,0:09:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do to make your\Ndreams fun is think they're fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.41,0:09:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, do you remember seeing\Nthe dog's carcass this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, the dog and\NI had the same dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in that dream, that dog\Nwas unmistakably slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.05,0:09:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I was awake, I found\Nthis cut on my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.19,0:09:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the enemy's stand. Death 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's stand? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.09,0:09:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're paranoid because you\Nhad a dream about stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.57,0:09:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you have got to take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.55,0:09:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a dream about stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.19,0:09:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand was in my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I said. You were\Nhaving a dream about stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.81,0:10:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you still don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.53,0:10:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loli-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.65,0:10:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, does it hurt being that stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.39,0:10:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, for the love of, let\Nme spell it out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.51,0:10:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that you're slow\Non the uptake, palmer-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming from the dog's wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.15,0:10:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lo-de-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to welcome\Nyou to my humble abode!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.87,0:10:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a dream, and I'm the Grand Reaper!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a megaphone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.81,0:10:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, stay on\Nguard and watch closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.11,0:10:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fiend is Death 13!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.09,0:10:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come forth, Hierophant Green!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:10:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hierophant, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.79,0:11:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I summon Hierophant?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.15,0:11:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.31,0:11:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get my stand to appear either!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.45,0:11:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it because we're in some\Nkind of twisted dream? Alley-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.99,0:11:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's romantic, wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being able to die in a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.27,0:11:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alley-ho!
