Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.83,0:11:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, do you sense that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.89,0:11:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, clear as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you know by now that\Nonly a stand can defeat a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to enter\Nyour eternal sleep, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.71,0:12:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alley-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull the ref! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull the ref.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.85,0:12:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Polnareff, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would appear our little\Ntraveler has wet himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.43,0:12:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do us all a favor and change his diaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone must have woken\Nthe fool from his slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.17,0:12:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's quite lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.87,0:12:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lollyho, I suppose it's no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he wakes up, he won't\Nremember a single thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to finish him\Nthe next time he falls asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.19,0:12:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means your death has been moved up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lollyho!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.31,0:12:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.97,0:12:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you woken up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like that diaper change this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm up, I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.99,0:13:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I feel like I had some\Nkind of terrifying nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't remember what happened at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've completely forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.61,0:13:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you change the boy's diaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can head back to dreamland\Nto finish your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.55,0:13:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't wake you up again
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.89,0:13:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mad. Hold on a second, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.93,0:13:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this the kid\Ntook a dump in his diaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at the size of\Nit Well, he is a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, that's why he wears diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.97,0:13:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Douglas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a vile, disgusting creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.95,0:13:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's gotten it all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you stop yapping and\Nchange the damn diaper already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.85,0:13:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you not embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.97,0:13:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do us all a favor and grow up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.13,0:13:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does this look right to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.67,0:13:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.57,0:13:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, I need you to\Nhold on to the edge there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna try and pin it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay. Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hold on to the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.63,0:14:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! It!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick, what's wrong? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.17,0:14:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lost control!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.33,0:14:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you saying that\Nwe're going to crash? Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, what's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been this way since he woke up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.09,0:14:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care, just calm him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.93,0:14:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, if you don't regain control\Nof this thing, we're all done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, you need to pull\Nyourself together pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.89,0:14:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're about to crash because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.91,0:14:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lally-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.43,0:15:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a restless sleeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.27,0:15:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, you'll kill us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.83,0:15:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and my user, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your user is that baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.71,0:15:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's only about six months old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm 11 months, almost a year old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may also interest you\Nto know that I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.85,0:15:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may poop in my diapers, but I know\Na hell of a lot more than you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.61,0:15:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.23,0:15:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with that, you've lost\Nyour ability to scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.53,0:15:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand within a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.49,0:15:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to let Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.09,0:15:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and Jotaro know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.63,0:15:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:15:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe spawn?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.78,0:15:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, level us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm working on that while\Ntrying to stay cool and collected?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not waking up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lally-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like no one's going\Nto notice if you're cutting
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your arm with a knife that's\Nsmaller than my wee-wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.73,0:16:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, you can hurt yourself all you want\Nin this dream, but it won't wake you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you're asleep, I completely\Ncontrol every iota of your precious mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand, Death 13,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.65,0:16:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,infiltrates the minds of its slumbering
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,victims when they are at\Ntheir most vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.55,0:16:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.47,0:16:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're crashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll control it with Hermit Purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.13,0:16:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lifted the plane just\Nin the nick of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.13,0:16:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a close one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem we managed\Nto avoid crashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.95,0:17:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was too close for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.13,0:17:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, what do you see to me killing\Nyou by crushing that heart of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.69,0:17:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and the others will think you had\Na heart attack and died of natural causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.75,0:17:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die, Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.17,0:17:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you guys see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.61,0:17:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you boys like them apples?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My flying's not too shabby!
