Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:17:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this enough, Mr. Joestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We survived, butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, what's going on, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.69,0:18:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I just\Nendured a horrible dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.83,0:18:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I awoke, I was utterly exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think there's something wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.43,0:18:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try and cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably a case of fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.05,0:18:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been about a month\Nnow since we left Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.77,0:18:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the enemy's been attacking\Nus non-stop ever since that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.93,0:18:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the baby's\Nfever has finally gone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness he's safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.93,0:18:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything were to happen to this\Nlittle guy, I'd never forgive myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.73,0:18:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peek-a-boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.45,0:18:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peek-a-boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.47,0:18:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has such an adorable\Nsmile, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't get what's so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.89,0:19:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not even making\Nany jokes, just faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.69,0:19:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, put a sock in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.41,0:19:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't my idea of\Na perfect night either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man, the radio survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.73,0:19:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we send out an SOS?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.57,0:19:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll mean Dio can find\Nus, but... We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.09,0:19:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's call for a rescue,\Nfor the baby's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was feeling\Ntwinches of pain. I'm bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, did I cut it when we crashed?
