Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.59,0:19:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.65,0:19:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cuts form letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.95,0:19:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby stand. But how did they? I don't\Nknow what it means, even though it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.01,0:19:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my handwriting I can't remember
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:20:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything did I do this to myself there
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't any blood on my knife but it\Nseems the cuts were made with this blade
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait a minute could I have really\Nforgotten violently cutting my own arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.39,0:20:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was told he was clever,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.47,0:20:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I never thought he'd actually\Ncarve letters into his arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while trying to wake himself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that look on\Nthe baby's face just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if he deliberately looked\Naway the moment I met his gaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby, stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.99,0:20:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby, stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.13,0:20:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but I might\Nbe losing my mind, because...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.33,0:21:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.17,0:21:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that this baby is a stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kakyoin, what do\Nyou think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.23,0:21:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.57,0:21:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is way too rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.09,0:21:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can strangle the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.89,0:21:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.61,0:21:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have something to eat, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.71,0:21:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should calm down once\Nhe has some food in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.37,0:21:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like poor Kakyoin's\Nreally losing it out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.45,0:21:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.03,0:21:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he'll make it\Nthrough the rest of this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.69,0:22:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.14,0:22:14.56,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.45,0:22:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.56,0:22:16.81,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.49,0:22:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.81,0:22:18.27,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.71,0:22:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.06,0:22:21.52,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.19,0:22:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the birds are men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.52,0:22:23.86,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.81,0:22:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got their money on\Na bed Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.86,0:22:26.19,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.19,0:22:27.70,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.47,0:22:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.36,0:22:30.82,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.45,0:22:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falling tight to the hookah? I say,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.82,0:22:33.03,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.93,0:22:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,walk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.04,0:22:42.59,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.81,0:22:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.43,0:22:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays,\Nspin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.97,0:22:56.43,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.43,0:22:58.81,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.43,0:22:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.81,0:23:00.06,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.93,0:23:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.10,0:23:03.44,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.91,0:23:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they bring you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.11,0:23:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.44,0:23:05.78,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.23,0:23:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sick of books?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.73,0:23:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.78,0:23:08.11,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.64,0:23:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the metal band.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.79,0:23:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.11,0:23:09.57,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.97,0:23:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're walking.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.41,0:23:12.74,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.95,0:23:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.05,0:23:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids. In the marketplace.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.74,0:23:14.95,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.09,0:23:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.17,0:23:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.08,0:23:25.17,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.79,0:23:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:26.42,0:23:28.42,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.37,0:23:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.45,0:23:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, Akemi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.73,0:23:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.64,0:23:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How stupid can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.63,0:23:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure that he's a stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.29,0:23:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't do that to yourself, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.31,0:23:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
